  "label": "Definition of child abuse",
  "description": "The meme uses the term 'child abuse' to describe the act of forcing children into religion. This requires background knowledge of legal and social definitions of child abuse, which typically include physical, emotional, sexual, or neglectful harm. The meme implicitly equates religious coercion with these forms of abuse, which is a controversial and contested interpretation in many religious and secular communities.",
